# Cloudflare Web Analytics site token.
#
# Public by design - the beacon ships it to the browser - so this is not a
# secret. Mint it in the Cloudflare dashboard under Web Analytics, Manage site.
#
# Must be present at BUILD time, not just runtime: NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined
# during `next build`, so in Cloudflare Workers Builds set it as a build
# variable. Leave it unset locally and pages/_document.tsx renders no beacon.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=